# ============================================================================
#  3DOF Delta Arm - action definition
#
#  set_pos action: sends a task-space target to the arm. A geometry_msgs/Twist
#  is used as the goal payload (fixed-size 3D coordinate through linear.x/y/z).
#
#  The ROS 2 action server is exposed as:   delta_arm/set_pos
# ============================================================================
## Goal: desired end-effector position (meters)
geometry_msgs/Twist target

---
## Result: completion summary
bool succeeded
string message

---
## Feedback: current end-effector estimate while the goal executes
geometry_msgs/Point current